Error codes: compare and convert with FFmpeg's AVERROR() and AVUNERROR()
instead of negating errno values. On Haiku errno values are negative and
AVERROR(e) is e, so -EAGAIN never matched and decoding stopped with
"Operation would block" after the first packet.

